## Tests

\`\`\`sh
GHIDRA_INSTALL_DIR=/path/to/ghidra $NAME/test/run-tests.sh [--real <workdir>]
\`\`\`
EOF

echo "Created $M"
echo "Next: tools/link-modules.sh, then $NAME/test/run-tests.sh. Add the module to README.md and STATUS.md in the same commit."
